(json)
{
  "body": "HTTP 503 (after 3 retries)\nTarget: https://pay.example/health\nType: HTTP(S)\nTime: 2026-10-19 14:03:12 UTC\nhttps://vv.example/monitors/7",
  "device_key": "secret-device_key",
  "group": "Vigilant Vole",
  "level": "timeSensitive",
  "title": "🔴 Payments API is down",
  "url": "https://vv.example/monitors/7"
}

### up
